    </sectiondef>
    <briefdescription>
<para>Represents a spatial patch in a landscape with a specific shape and priority. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The <ref refid="class_patch" kindref="compound">Patch</ref> class stores information about an environmental patch, including its source, geometric shape, priority, and associated filename. It provides methods to check coverage of terrain cells, compare patches by priority, and access the source. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
